Hi,
 
FYI - This is the MIB mapping of the abstract counters defined in the
Imaging System Counters spec (also in IEEE/ISTO PWG 'last call').
 
In April in Tokyo, the Counter spec and Counter MIB last calls will be
discussed on Friday morning (simultaneously with FSG/OP sessions).
 
Cheers,
- Ira (editor of Counter MIB)
 

