Subject: WIMS> Last Call for the Imaging Services Counter MIB



In accord with the PWG process document,
ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/general/pwg-process20.pdf
<ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/general/pwg-process20.pdf> , the PWG Imaging
Counter MIB has completed working group last call. The PWG -wide last call
period for the Imaging Counter MIB is now open and will close on or about 1
May.

The MIB, largely a product of Ira McDonald, is posted  in both a full-text
standard form and a ASN.1 MIB only form.

 ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/wims/wd/wd-wimscountmib10-20050319.htm
    - full text - PWG boilerplate, introduction, model, references

  ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/wims/wd/wd-wimscountmib10-20050319.mib
<ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/wims/wd/wd-wimscountmib10-20050319.mib> 
    - ASN.1 MIB source only

Following existing precedent from the Character Repertoires WG,
the PWG Last Call will take place on the HTML version.  After completion of
PWG Last Call, this document will be converted from HTML to MS Word. 


Please send any comments to the wims@pwg.org <mailto:wims@pwg.org>  list.
Please do not respond  to the PWG-ANNOUNCE list.  

Bill Wagner, Chairman WIMS Working Group


